I actually ascended a rogue in orange dragon scale mail. Having a
sleep attack that ignores magic resistance can save your skin when
you're surrounded by nasties. The biggest problem I have with either
wish is the difficulty of the castle without reflection. Magicbane and
Elbereth are useless versus massed infantry, and Magicbane won't
protect from the sentries' wands of lightning or fire.

For the reasons above, I'd much rather have reflection + genocided L
before the Sporkhack castle than either previously mentioned wish. But
to each his own.


